('home.vision.text','Home','Growth vision text','We aspire to grow into a nationwide network with university chapters, mentorship initiatives, academic resources, events and collaborations. These are future ambitions — not achievements we claim today.','We aspire to grow into a nationwide network with university chapters, mentorship initiatives, academic resources, events and collaborations. These are future ambitions — not achievements we claim today.','public'),
